        greaterThanOrEqualTo(1),
        reason:
            'a sticky scenario has nothing to re-serve without at least one '
            'scripted response (matched-but-dry still answers 500 — '
            'mock_llm_server.dart _nextEntry)',
      );
    },
  );
}

